# ================================================================
# cce-teaching-packages .gitignore
# 策略：allowlist（只允許明確列出的副檔名/目錄進入 repo）
# ================================================================

# ---- 預設拒絕一切 ----
# （透過 allowlist 反向開放）
*

# ================================================================
# ALLOWLIST - 明確允許追蹤的檔案
# ================================================================

# --- repo 頂層設定 ---
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!LICENSE
!CONTENT-LICENSE.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md

# --- GitHub Actions ---
!.github/
!.github/**

# --- packages/ 下允許的教案內容 ---
!packages/
!packages/**/
!packages/**/_index.json
!packages/**/_meta.json
!packages/**/README.md
!packages/**/data_card.json
!packages/**/version.json
!packages/**/resources.json
!packages/**/lesson_plan.md
!packages/**/lesson_plan.html
!packages/**/ppt_script.md
!packages/**/ppt.html
!packages/**/worksheet.html
!packages/**/resources.md
!packages/**/qa_report.md

# --- 網站程式碼 ---
!web/
!web/**/
# 以下在 web/ 下允許的檔案類型
!web/**/*.ts
!web/**/*.tsx
!web/**/*.js
!web/**/*.mjs
!web/**/*.json
!web/**/*.css
!web/**/*.svg
!web/**/*.png
!web/**/*.ico
!web/**/*.txt
!web/**/*.md
!web/**/*.example
!web/.gitignore

# --- build / 同步腳本 ---
!scripts/
!scripts/*.mjs
!scripts/*.js
!scripts/*.cjs
!scripts/README.md

# --- Claude Code skills（團隊共用流程,不含私人資料）---
# 用絕對路徑(開頭 /)只允許 repo 根目錄的 .claude/skills/,
# 不可用不帶斜線的寫法,否則會連 packages/.claude/(worktree 暫存)一起解禁。
!/.claude/
!/.claude/skills/
!/.claude/skills/**/
!/.claude/skills/**/*.md

# ================================================================
# BLOCKLIST - 即使在 allowlist 範圍內也明確拒絕
# ================================================================

# 絕對禁止：密鑰 / 憑證
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_dsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519
service-account*.json
firebase-adminsdk*.json
google-services.json
credentials.json
secrets.json
*token*.txt
*apikey*

# 絕對禁止：內部文件
docs/
PLAN.md
PLAN*.md
ARCHITECTURE*.md
MAINTAINER*.md
SECURITY_BASELINE*.md
*_SOP.md
*_GUIDE.md
TRAINING*.md
TESTING*.md

# 絕對禁止：表單 / 個資相關
forms/
*_notify.gs
sheet_columns*.md
review_workflow*.md
form_spec*.md

# 絕對禁止：衍生產物 / 大型檔案
node_modules/
.next/
out/
web/data/
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.xlsx
*.docx
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.rar
*.7z
slides*.json
slides*.pptx

# 絕對禁止：本機 / IDE
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*.log
_cache/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
*.pyc

# 絕對禁止：草稿 / 個人筆記
_local/
NOTES.local.md
TODO.local.md
scratch/
.private/
*.local.json

# 絕對禁止：qa 中間產物（只允許 qa_report.md）
qa_data.md
qa_lesson.md
qa_ppt.md
qa_worksheet.md
qa_early.md
qa_depth.md
# package.json/lock 只在 packages/ 下禁止，web/ 下必須存在
packages/**/package.json
packages/**/package-lock.json
# root level 雜項腳本
build.js
build_v2.js
outputs/

# 絕對禁止：舊版備份(只留本機,不進 public repo)
packages/**/_versions/
